; ========================================
; ＞『ラウンジ』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进会客厅时，<br>发现亚里沙正坐在沙发上。|#0103Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然本打算去找大家，<br>但看到亚里沙的身影，艾玛不由得犹豫了。|#0103Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（该、该怎么办……要打招呼吗……？）|#0103Adv08_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为刚才在医务室发生的事，<br>艾玛的脚步变得迟疑。|#0103Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:……是樱羽啊。|#0103Adv08_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛踌躇不前时，<br>亚里沙先开口了。|#0103Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才那个……抱歉。|#0103Adv08_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我本来不想那么凶的。<br>只是，实在是太烦躁了……|#0103Adv08_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙吞吞吐吐地说着，<br>这种反常的态度让艾玛感到惊讶。|#0103Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（亚里沙并不是坏孩子……<br>　这一点我早就知道了……）|#0103Adv08_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:别在意。那个，你的身体状况怎么样？|#0103Adv08_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上告诉你药的事了吧。|#0103Adv08_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……嗯。|#0103Adv08_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:冰上太过保护，说得太夸张了。<br>就算多吃一点，也不会对身体有什么影响。<br>我已经习惯了。|#0103Adv08_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是这样吗……？|#0103Adv08_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:别误会，那不是什么违禁药物。<br>只是吃药能让我安心。|#0103Adv08_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被关在这种地方……<br>怎么可能保持理智。所以……|#0103Adv08_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，我能理解你的不安。<br>但是，如果对身体有害的话就不好了……|#0103Adv08_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那个！今天我们要去野餐。<br>亚里沙要一起来吗？|#0103Adv08_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:比起一个人胡思乱想，<br>和大家一起玩会更开心哦！|#0103Adv08_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:……我考虑一下。|#0103Adv08_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然亚里沙看起来很疲惫，<br>但对艾玛的态度明显温和了许多。|#0103Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（想和亚里沙变得更亲近。<br>　如果大家都能好好相处的话——）|#0103Adv08_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（就再也不会发生凶杀案了）|#0103Adv08_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:我先过去了，<br>如果你愿意的话就来吧！我们等你！|#0103Adv08_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛鼓起勇气说完，<br>便离开了会客厅。|#0103Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——亚里沙被留在原地。|#0103Adv08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她深深地叹了口气后，<br>仰望着天花板。|#0103Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:……差不多该行动了吧。|#0103Adv08_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经到极限了。<br>我已经——|#0103Adv08_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

